        .grid-item
          a href="http://docs.nitrous.io/v1.0/docs/snapshots" target="_blank"
            = image_tag 'home/_tutorial-docker-1.jpg', alt: 'Tutorial'
            h3 Tutorial: Create Images from a Container
            p Images (aka snapshots) save the exact state of a container and can be used to backup, share and clone development environments.
        
        .grid-item
