            h3 Tutorial: Connect to a Docker Registry
            p Nitrous Pro offers the ability to push and pull images to a Docker registry.
        
        .grid-item
          a href="http://docs.nitrous.io/v1.0/docs/pull-a-repository-from-docker-hub" target="_blank"
            = image_tag 'home/_tutorial-docker-3.jpg', alt: 'Tutorial'
            h3 Tutorial: Pull Images from a Docker Registry
            p You can pull images directly from a Docker registry into a new container. Alternatively, you can create a container with an existing snapshot.
        
        .grid-item
          a href="http://docs.nitrous.io/v1.0/docs/push-images-to-a-docker-registry" target="_blank"
